{"publicId":"c29cc0b4-b0f8-4810-b33a-21ffce406504","title":"Linux内核NoisyTCP漏洞（CVE-2026-99288）导致远程崩溃","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T12:50:29.137Z","latestAt":"2026-11-16T12:50:29.137Z","digest":"Hyunwoo Kim于2026-11-16向Linux内核维护团队提交的CVE-2026-99288漏洞披露，证实NoisyTCP模块存在11年未修复的远程破坏漏洞。攻击者可通过特定配置远程触发导致宿主机崩溃，影响几乎所有主流Linux发行版。缓解措施包括禁用SYN cookies或限制RX队列大小，但需注意bare-metal服务器需14小时以上触发条件，虚拟机环境仅需5-2分钟。该漏洞由Linux内核维护团队通过公开邮件列表确认，尚未发布官方补丁。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-16T21:52:44.123Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Linux内核NoisyTCP模块存在11年潜伏的CVE-2026-99288远程破坏漏洞","latestReport":{"id":"kz4kuhq5kosb7smyqehskkg8e"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fvzPE66-v6VM","title":"NoisyTCP: Linux Kernel TCP Pre-auth Remote Corruption (CVE-2","firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T12:50:29.137Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"kz4kuhq5kosb7smyqehskkg8e","title":"Linux内核NoisyTCP模块存在11年潜伏的CVE-2026-99288远程破坏漏洞","summary":"Hyunwoo Kim 报告的 NoisyTCP 漏洞（CVE-2026-99288）在 Linux 内核中潜伏了约11年，影响几乎所有发行版，可通过禁用 SYN cookies 或限制 RX 队列临时缓解。触发需特定配置， bare-metal服务器需14小时以上，虚拟机约5-2分钟，攻击者可远程触发导致宿主机崩溃。","source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T12:50:29.137Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"kz4kuhq5kosb7smyqehskkg8e","title":"Linux内核NoisyTCP模块存在11年潜伏的CVE-2026-99288远程破坏漏洞","summary":"Hyunwoo Kim 报告的 NoisyTCP 漏洞（CVE-2026-99288）在 Linux 内核中潜伏了约11年，影响几乎所有发行版，可通过禁用 SYN cookies 或限制 RX 队列临时缓解。触发需特定配置， bare-metal服务器需14小时以上，虚拟机约5-2分钟，攻击者可远程触发导致宿主机崩溃。","source":{"name":"Lobsters 热榜","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T12:50:29.137Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-16T22:00:00.000Z","heat":7.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-16T23:00:00.000Z","heat":7.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T00:00:00.000Z","heat":7.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T01:00:00.000Z","heat":7,"participants":1}